{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Harmony 的输入契约要求每个细胞都有协变量标签；如果 IntegrateLayers 调用时未提供或未正确对齐这些标签，后续层结构可能异常。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Harmony accepts a matrix of cells and covariate labels for each cell as input."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Harmony 需要从一个低维嵌入开始，PCA 只是示例而非唯一必需方法；若 IntegrateLayers 未找到或未生成合适的嵌入，可能影响后续结果。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Harmony, described in detail in Supplementary Note 1, begins with a low dimensional embedding of cells, such as Principal Components Analysis (PCA), that meets 3 key criteria (online methods)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "RunHarmony 的 Seurat 接口要求对象中已预先计算好适当的细胞嵌入槽位；若该槽位缺失或为空，IntegrateLayers 可能无法正常写入结果。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "@param object the Seurat object. It needs to have the appropriate slot\n#'     of cell embeddings precomputed."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "group.by.vars 参数指定 Harmony 要移除效应的协变量；若该参数未正确设置，可能影响整合结果，但不会直接解释层数为零。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "@param group.by.vars the name(s) of covariates that harmony will remove\n#'     its effect on the data."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的观察是 RNA assay 报告零层，且操作顺序为 IntegrateLayers(HarmonyIntegration) 后 JoinLayers；这属于当前状态，不能据此推断根因。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:observed_state",
        "user:operation_sequence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "检查结果：当前没有绑定输入数据，也没有可用的测量结果，因此无法直接检查对象内部层结构。",
      "basis": "OBSERVED_STATE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "observed:status",
        "observed:input_registered",
        "observed:measurements_available"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：关于 Seurat 对象在 RunHarmony 后的层访问行为，现有证据仅覆盖 SingleCellExperiment 的 reducedDim 访问方式，不能据此推断 Seurat 5.3.0 的层行为。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "SingleCellExperiment object. After running RunHarmony, the corrected\ncell embeddings can be accessed with reducedDim(object, \"Harmony\")."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "建议的只读 triage 顺序：先检查 IntegrateLayers 调用前后的 assay 层清单，再检查 JoinLayers 前后的层清单，最后检查 IntegrateLayers 是否实际写入了预期层。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "能否提供 IntegrateLayers 调用前后以及 JoinLayers 调用前后的 RNA assay 层清单（例如 Layers(seurat_obj[['RNA']]) 的输出）？",
    "missing_field": "layer_inventory_before_after",
    "why_needed": "只有对比各步骤前后的层清单，才能判断层是在 IntegrateLayers 阶段未生成，还是在 JoinLayers 阶段被合并或移除，从而定位零层现象发生的具体步骤。"
  }
}
